## Constrained revision required

Use one pure helper in `orchestrator/team_records.py` from both implementer and independent branches. It must select the exact assignment by actor, permitted role, effective subject, and one evidence pair before full validation. Then preserve every existing validation on the selected assignment: owner, epoch, model/effort, source, payload, evidence, launch/result phases, completion, and for `FIX_VERIFIED` the repair artifact, base, and candidate manifest. Owner transitions remain unchanged.

The revision stays within `orchestrator/team_records.py` and `orchestrator/tests/test_workflow_runtime.py`. No schema, command, role, policy, history-repair, source-integration, mathematical, commit, or publication change is reviewed or authorized here.
